  rawText: "does your heart, with its sole privilege of beating, ache in its cage\u2019s
    presence? you\u2019ve changed. is it so burdening a truth, that you\u2019ve surrendered
    to permanence? oh sweetness, don\u2019t cry. it\u2019s unsightly for a face so
    handsome."
